      "A roofing square is often used at one-tenth scale.",
      "If the run is 3000 mm and the rise is 2500 mm, the square would use 300 mm and 250 mm.",
      "These smaller measurements are then repeated along the rafter to reach the full length.",
      "If the run is 300 mm and the rise is also 300 mm, the roof pitch is 45 degrees."
